delay 191
text I find Kotomi, silhouetted against the summer sunlight.
sound ~
text Leaning on the gatepost, she expectantly looks toward the road, the air above which is shimmering in the heat.
text The midsummer breeze flutters her white dress as it blows past.
text She seems more mature.
text Maybe it's just my imagination.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKT08B"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
