setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
sound EH2.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Oh...
text She sees me and breaks out into a smile.
sound EH3.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, hello.
text The usual greeting that I'm more than familiar with.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. Hello.
text And then she turns to Kyou.
sound EH4.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Kyou-chan, hello.
sound EH5.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Thanks for waiting. I made sure we didn't drop it this time.
text Kyou is holding up a violin case.
text Three months have passed since the day the violin was broken.
text The repairs it needed were that extensive.
text Even after everything the stubborn old man at the instrument shop said, he still went through with fixing it.
text Lots of other people helped us out, too.
text And earlier today, the violin was finally returned to us.
text It will now be presented to its rightful owner.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKT08A"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
