text Not yet.
sound EH7.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text ...
sound EH8.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Kyou-chan, you meanie.
text She pouts like a puppy dog.
sound EH9.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Just wait for it. I'm sure you'll be pleasantly surprised when you play it.
