text I still have my Violin Redemption Ticket.
sound EHC.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Just put it away. It'll be horrible if the wind blows it out of your hand.
text @[Tomoya]
text Everyone else is out shopping.
text @[Tomoya]
text They'll be back in about thirty minutes. Let's start then.
